                                "sense_id": "691e5454-9a55-331f-90bf-df6cee92fcba",
                                "text": "I've bought a couple of Greek tets that must have been dipped because all the toning is off them. They're white, but otherwise nice. Other tets I've bought have been cleaned as well but have more gray and other coloring and therefore look better."
