            {
                "entry_id": "da8ddbc9-3ec9-3f23-b20e-8775e8b18749",
                "word": "TET",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6ec620f3-efa1-4247-bba1-ad8fef61f04a",
                        "entry_id": "da8ddbc9-3ec9-3f23-b20e-8775e8b18749",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "TETs"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1f7494c9-6ae1-3b6f-b0e6-60ac1069d3fe",
                        "entry_id": "da8ddbc9-3ec9-3f23-b20e-8775e8b18749",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of tetraethyltin."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "03167257-2637-3135-b416-06b6c1732299",
                        "entry_id": "da8ddbc9-3ec9-3f23-b20e-8775e8b18749",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of transparency-enhancing tool."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45ad9c64-e42b-489f-93bf-0f885a84ae93",
                                "sense_id": "03167257-2637-3135-b416-06b6c1732299",
                                "text": "TETs of the first and last categories are also called ex-ante TETs, as they provide transparency of any intended data processing to the data subjects before they are releasing any personal data."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "69a51b9a-1dca-47b9-b764-f8b0308c53a1",
                                "sense_id": "03167257-2637-3135-b416-06b6c1732299",
                                "text": "There are two classes of TETs that can be leveraged to identify, assess, and mitigate risks related to the lack of awareness on OSNs: user-side tools and provider-side tools."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "028c63c8-5193-4602-9c88-8b0597343aa6",
                                "sense_id": "03167257-2637-3135-b416-06b6c1732299",
                                "text": "If we define transparency as insight in how user's data is being collected, stored, processed and disclosed, TETs can then be viewed as tools providing this insight in an accurate and comprehensible way."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce01d828-70cc-38af-9a94-adfa229c3f71",
                        "entry_id": "da8ddbc9-3ec9-3f23-b20e-8775e8b18749",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of thymic epithelial tumor."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b8647bed-a5df-432c-807c-c555d9e834fd",
                                "sense_id": "ce01d828-70cc-38af-9a94-adfa229c3f71",
                                "text": "TETs were classified according to Müller-Hermelink and co-workers [15, 19]."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "141d435e-6468-44c7-a11d-9893a8cff49f",
                                "sense_id": "ce01d828-70cc-38af-9a94-adfa229c3f71",
                                "text": "We conducted a multicenter study to determine the activity and tolerability of this regimen in pretreated TETs."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "248f83ca-6225-407a-9178-1ff275194174",
                                "sense_id": "ce01d828-70cc-38af-9a94-adfa229c3f71",
                                "text": "Because of the role of the thymus in the immune system, TETs (thymomas more so than thymic carcinomas) are associated with autoimmune paraneoplastic syndromes, and a higher risk of second malignancies."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "112aa985-4610-30e8-a3be-c42c59610429",
                        "entry_id": "da8ddbc9-3ec9-3f23-b20e-8775e8b18749",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Initialism of targeted energy transfer."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "abbreviation",
                            "alt-of",
                            "countable",
                            "initialism",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "82f29537-5b65-4250-9962-a50dea910eb8",
                                "sense_id": "112aa985-4610-30e8-a3be-c42c59610429",
                                "text": "Moreover, we demonstrate that SMRs are related to relaxation oscillations of the corresponding averaged dynamical flows (the slow flows of the dynamics), and in fact, one can regard SMRs as a form of repetitive TETs under the action of persistent periodic forcing."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5aa354ae-0682-4919-972c-7914e31a2124",
                                "sense_id": "112aa985-4610-30e8-a3be-c42c59610429",
                                "text": "In an earlier work we showed computationally that it is possible to successfully employ nonlinear targeted energy transfers (TETs) for seismic mitigation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "63872451-43a9-4eed-b960-3642ffc40abf",
                                "sense_id": "112aa985-4610-30e8-a3be-c42c59610429",
                                "text": "We study complex damped and undamped dynamics and targeted energy transfers (TETs) in systems of coupled oscillators, consisting of single-degree-of-freedom pri."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
